+## Evidence and next milestone
+
+Passing CI verifies the repository checks and synthetic fixtures. It does not prove a working tenant deployment, supported console permissions, or licensed retention. Each module must record its tenant validation evidence before being described as operationally complete.
+
+The next milestone is module 03: onboard one Linux lab source, show sanitized raw and parsed events, validate timestamps and required fields, and document delivery latency, restart behavior and troubleshooting. Then demonstrate one detection against those events before expanding to additional sources.
+
